  "title": {
   "en": "Tensei Nanmin Shoujo wa Shimin-ken wo 0 Kara Mezashite Hatarakimasu"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "転生難民少女は市民権を０から目指して働きます！@COMIC"
   },
   {
    "ja-ro": "Tensei Nanmin Shoujo wa Shimin-ken o 0 Kara Mezashite Hatarakimasu"
   },
   {
    "en": "The Reincarnated Refugee Girl Works Hard to Gain Citizenship from Zero"
   },
   {
    "id": "Gadis Pengungsi Yang Bereinkarnasi Bekerja Keras Untuk Mendapatkan Kewarganegaraan Dari Nol"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Lill, who was reincarnated into a refugee settlement, is once again starving today. To make matters worse, she's being shunned because of her lazy parents and is on the verge of being exiled!? Determined to secure her place, she works hard every day to earn the trust of the residents, even if just a little. Her earnest efforts as a small girl gradually start to gain recognition from those around her. Her dream? To one day eat a warm, hearty meal until she's full! Then, she learns that even a refugee can live in town if they become a B-rank adventurer—so she sets her sights on escaping her refugee status!",
   "ja": "難民集落に転生したリルは今日もおなかがぺこぺこだった。おまけに、働かない両親のせいで仲間外れにされ、追放寸前！？居場所を守るため、少しでも住民の信頼を得ようとお手伝いに励む毎日。小さな少女の一生懸命な姿は、少しずつ周囲からも認められるように。いつかほかほかごはんをおなかいっぱい食べたい！と意気込む彼女は、難民でも町に暮らす方法があると知ってーー？めざすは脱難民！"
  },
